hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"467","Muhammad ibn al-Sabbah ibn Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Awza'i se ke unhon ne al-Zuhri se suna, woh is baat ka inkar kar rahe the ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne apni mumaniat ke baad ghare ki nabeedh ki ijazat di thi, aur jo shakhs is ka da'wa karta hai us ko bura-bhala kehte the."
